TITLE Viscosity after adding H2SO4 stepwise
SOLUTION 1 Pure water pH 7
    pH 7 charge
    temp 25
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
REACTION 1
    H2SO4 1
    0.001 0.005 0.01 0.05 0.1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file viscosity_step1.sel
    -reset false
    -totals S(6)
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step viscosity
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, VISC
END
